This template is to be used under a ''Licensing'' heading on file pages to denote the file's license.
== Available licenses == === Game === * Usage: <nowiki>{{License|game}}</nowiki> {{License|game|doc=}}
=== Fairuse === * Usage: <nowiki>{{License|fairuse}}</nowiki> {{License|fairuse|doc=}}
=== CC0 === * Usage: <nowiki>{{License|CC0}}</nowiki> {{License|CC0|doc=}}
=== CC-BY-NC-ND === * Usage: <nowiki>{{License|CC-BY-NC-ND}}</nowiki> {{License|CC-BY-NC-ND|doc=}}
=== CC-BY-NC-SA === * Usage: <nowiki>{{License|CC-BY-NC-SA}}</nowiki> {{License|CC-BY-NC-SA|doc=}}
=== CC-BY-NC === * Usage: <nowiki>{{License|CC-BY-NC}}</nowiki> {{License|CC-BY-NC|doc=}}
=== CC-BY-ND === * Usage: <nowiki>{{License|CC-BY-ND}}</nowiki> {{License|CC-BY-ND|doc=}}
=== CC-BY-SA === * Usage: <nowiki>{{License|CC-BY-SA}}</nowiki> {{License|CC-BY-SA|doc=}}
=== CC-BY === * Usage: <nowiki>{{License|CC-BY}}</nowiki> {{License|CC-BY|doc=}}
=== CC-PD === * Usage: <nowiki>{{License|CC-PD}}</nowiki> {{License|CC-PD|doc=}}
=== CC-SRR === * Usage: <nowiki>{{License|CC-SRR}}</nowiki> {{License|CC-SRR|doc=}}
=== Permission === * Usage: <nowiki>{{License|permission}}</nowiki> {{License|permission|doc=}}
=== No license === '''Providing no parameter (or invalid one) defaults to the nolicense notice:'''
<nowiki>{{License}}</nowiki>{{License|doc=}}
== Specifying source == '''Source parameter (optional):'''
The source parameter accepts a url to the source where the file came from if necessary for attribution.
Example:
<nowiki>{{License|game|source=https://indie.io/}}</nowiki> {{License|game|doc=|source=https://indie.io/}}
<includeonly> [[Category:License templates]] </includeonly> <noinclude>[[Category:Template documentation]]</noinclude>

