{| class="wikitable" |- | {{Luggage|Regular}} || <syntaxhighlight lang="wikitext">{{Luggage|Regular}}</syntaxhighlight> |- | {{Luggage|Big}} || <syntaxhighlight lang="wikitext">{{Luggage|Big}}</syntaxhighlight> |- | {{Explorer's}} || <syntaxhighlight lang="wikitext">{{Luggage|Explorer's}}</syntaxhighlight> |- | {{Luggage|Ancient}} || <syntaxhighlight lang="wikitext">{{Luggage|Ancient}}</syntaxhighlight> |- | {{Luggage|Clown}} || <syntaxhighlight lang="wikitext">{{Luggage|Clown}}</syntaxhighlight> |}
[[Category:Template documentation]]

{{Uses Lua|Loot table}}
This template generates tables displaying spawn chances of items inside luggages. Meant for usage on the [[Luggage]] page.

Item spawn chances are hardcoded in the module, where they can be adjusted if necessary.

== Dependencies ==
* [[Module:Loot table]]

== Usage ==
<syntaxhighlight lang="wikitext">
{{Loot table|Regular Luggage}}
{{Loot table|Big Luggage}}
{{Loot table|Explorer's Luggage}}
{{Loot table|Ancient Luggage}}
{{Loot table|Clown Luggage}}
{{Loot table|Ancient Statue}}
</syntaxhighlight>

Full name is required, which can be typed in any case.

=== Notes parameter ===
Each generated table's column headers carry <code><nowiki><ref></nowiki></code> notes clarifying what information the column hold. 
Adding <code><nowiki><references group="n"/></nowiki></code> near the bottom od the page is '''required''' (see the [[#Notes]] header below) to display them.

There is also an option to disable the notes per table (per template call) with <code>notes=false</code>:
<syntaxhighlight lang="wikitext">
{{Loot table|Regular Luggage|notes=false}}
</syntaxhighlight>

=== Big Luggage ===
{{Loot table|Big Luggage}}

=== Ancient Luggage ===
{{Loot table|Ancient Luggage}}

=== Clown Luggage ===
{{Loot table|Clown Luggage}}

== Notes == 
<references group="n"/>

'''Template:Navbox food''' creates a [[support:RANGER navboxes|navbox]] for all food items in {{Peak game}}.

== Copyable code ==
<syntaxhighlight lang="wikitext">
{{Navbox food}}
</syntaxhighlight>

{{clear}}

== Sample ==
{{navbox food}}

